# 🎯 Project Objective

The objective is to build a practical Linux system health monitoring utility using **Bash scripting**.

The project is also being used to develop practical knowledge of:

- Linux system administration
- Bash scripting
- Linux `/proc` filesystem
- CPU and memory monitoring
- Text processing
- Error handling
- Modular scripting
- Git
- GitHub
- DevOps workflows
- Automation

---

# 🧰 Technology Stack

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Ubuntu 24.04 LTS | Linux environment |
| WSL2 | Linux environment on Windows |
| Bash | Monitoring scripts |
| `/proc` filesystem | Linux system statistics |
| `awk` | Data processing |
| `grep` | Text filtering |
| `cut` | Text extraction |
| Git | Version control |
| GitHub | Remote repository |

